tron transfer flavoprotein FAD-binding</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td align="left">Electron transfer flavoprotein domain</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="center">GB12827</td><td align="center">GroupUn.5348</td><td align="center">Dox-A2-PA</td><td align="center">CG10484</td><td align="center">Q(0.42)</td><td align="left">PCI domain</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="center">GB10658</td><td align="center">Group14.24</td><td align="center">l(3)neo18-PA</td><td align="center">CG9762</td><td align="center">W(0.70)</td><td align="left">--</td></tr><tr><td colspan="7"><hr></hr></td></tr><tr><td align="left"><bold>JH responsive (6)</bold></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td align="left"><bold>Metabolic enzymes (6.1)</bold></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="center">GB19085</td><td align="center">Group13.10</td><td align="center">CG9009-PA</td><td align="center">CG9009</td><td align="center">Q(1.10)</td><td align="left">AM P-binding enzyme</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="center">GB16747</td><td align="center">Group4.23</td><td align="center">CG17323-PA</td><td align="center">CG17323</td><td align="center">Q(0.46)</td><td align="left">UDP-glucoronosyl and UDP-glucosyl transferase</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="center">GB15619</td><td align="center">Group2.43</td><td align="center">CG8036-PC</td><td align="center">CG8036</td><td align="center">Q(0.33)</td><td align="left">Transketolase, thiamine diphosphate binding domain</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td align="left">Transketolase, pyridine binding domain</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td align="left">Transketolase, C-terminal domain</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="center">GB13982</td><td align="center">Group13.10</td><td align="center">Faa-PA</td><td align="center">CG14993</td><td align="center">W(0.34)</td><td align="left">F